n class=\"fn\">x</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.GNat.toNat\">toNat</a></span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Sqrt/Basic.html#Nat.sqrt\">sqrt</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.toNat_sqrtRemZ","kind":"theorem","line":197,"name":"MPN.Bridge.toNat_sqrtRemZ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Bridge.lean#L197-L250"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.sqrtRemZ\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Bridge</span>.<span class=\"name\">sqrtRemZ</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.NatLimbs\">NatLimbs</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge\">Bridge</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">T </span><span class=\"fn\">RT</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.GNat\">GNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.GNat\">GNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.GNat\">GNat</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`(⌊√x⌋, x - ⌊√x⌋²)` for `x ≠ 0` as `sqrtZ`, with the remainder from the recursion's: when `c = 0`,\n`N = x` and the recursion's remainder is `x`'s; otherwise, with `S = s 2ᶜ + s₀` the root of\n`N = x 4ᶜ` and `R = N - S²`, `x - s² = (R + 2 s s₀ 2ᶜ + s₀²) / 4ᶜ`, a product by `s₀ < 2ᶜ` instead\nof the square of the root, as in GMP's `mpn_sqrtrem`, for roots of `RT` limbs or more, and\n`x - s²` below, where the square costs less than the passes of the other.","docLink":"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.sqrtRemZ","kind":"def","line":143,"name":"MPN.Bridge.sqrtRemZ","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-mpn/blob/0c3e72656c98060de12dca90ae58fec3c9765095/MPN/Bridge.lean#L143-L165"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.toNat_sqrtZ\"><span class=\"name\">MPN</span>.<span class=\"name\">Bridge</span>.<span class=\"name\">toNat_sqrtZ</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">A</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\">C</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Natural.html#MPN.NatLimbs\">NatLimbs</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span></span>]</span></span> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">α</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">b</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge\">Bridge</a> <span class=\"fn\">A</span> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">base</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">α</span> → <span class=\"fn\">α</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">α</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">T</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hbase</span> :\n  <span class=\"fn\">∀ (<span class=\"fn\">N</span> : <span class=\"fn\">α</span>) (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>),\n    <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">1</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> →\n      <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">T</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Or\">∨</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LE.le\">≤</a> <span class=\"fn\">1</span> →\n        <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.o\">o</a></span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.val\">val</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">N</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">b</span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Bridge.html#MPN.Bridge.o\">o</a></span>.<a href=\"./MPN/Generic/Ops.html#MPN.NatOps.B\">B</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HPow.hPow\">^</a> (<span class=\"fn\">2</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HMul.hMul\">*</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>) →\n          <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span